    "estimated": "11.00 occ x 5 min/occ (estimate, mid of 3-15, basis inferred, 5 quotes from 5 occurrences) = 55.00 min = 11.96 min/mo; automatable 40% (estimate) = 4.78 min/mo; at the low end 3 min/occ = $8.48/mo, at the high end 15 min/occ = $24.74/mo (the row's automatable total)",
